      "dependencies": [
        "5E80000000000007"
      ],
      "description": [
        "Macerate Raw Nickel in your existing steam Macerator. The native recipe guarantees one nickel dust per raw nickel and has a 50% chance for another.",
        "Do not wait for an Electric Macerator: its cutting blade needs invar and diamond dust. Your steam machine deliberately breaks that bootstrap loop."
      ],
      "tasks": [
        {
