      ],
      "description": [
        "Mix two iron dust with one nickel dust into three invar dust. Your existing steam Mixer handles this low-energy alloy recipe.",
        "Invar becomes heatproof casings and cutting hardware. Stockpile it alongside steel; the Electric Blast Furnace will use a substantial casing batch."
      ],
      "tasks": [
        {
