      "description": [
        "Extend the line to Basic Hulls, Motors, Pistons, Conveyors and Robot Arms. Automate one recipe at a time and keep small buffers between stages.",
        "Confirm once you can order another basic electric machine using buffered parts. There is no requirement to create an enormous factory or fill a chest of every component."
